message: "If you use these data or scripts, please cite this archive and the accompanying manuscript."
type: software
title: "Data and code for a mass-uniform L1 method for nonlinear fractional networks"
authors:
  - family-names: Zatsepin
    given-names: Daniil
    affiliation: "Ryazan State University named after S.A. Yesenin"
