abstract: >-
  Numerical data and reproducibility scripts accompanying the manuscript
  A mass-uniform L1 method for nonlinear fractional networks with independent
  vanishing masses. Includes saved results, full trajectories where retained,
  reference checks, and table and figure generation scripts.
keywords:
  - fractional differential equations
  - L1 method
  - layer-adapted meshes
  - parameter-uniform convergence
  - reproducibility
